# SORT_CARD with a custom order: Fruits of Kozaky's Studies (Normal Trap) rearranges the top 3
# cards of the deck. `sort` lists the cards from the new top down. Set on turn 1, activated on
# turn 3; the extra Mystical Elf on top is the card p0 draws on turn 3.
start_draw 0 0
start_draw 1 0
card 0 hand 49998907        # Fruits of Kozaky's Studies
card 0 deck 15025844        # Mystical Elf (bottom)
card 0 deck 26202165        # Sangan
card 0 deck 43096270        # Alexandrite Dragon
card 0 deck 89631139        # Blue-Eyes White Dragon
card 0 deck 15025844        # Mystical Elf (top, drawn on turn 3)
card 1 deck 15025844 x5

0 idle sset 49998907
0 idle end
1 idle end
expect cards 0 deck 15025844 26202165 43096270 89631139   # bottom -> top before sorting
0 idle activate 49998907
0 sort 26202165 89631139 43096270   # new top: Sangan, then Blue-Eyes, then Alexandrite
expect cards 0 deck 15025844 43096270 89631139 26202165   # bottom -> top
stop
